>Ferrari</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Hegyi</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Yin</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1998</year><article-title>Prion protein expression in different species: analysis with a panel of new mAbs.</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>95</volume><fpage>8812</fpage><lpage>8816</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9671761</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003872-Korth1"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Korth</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Stierli</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Streit</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Moser</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Schaller</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1997</year><article-title>Prion (PrPSc)-specific epitope defined by a monoclonal antibody.</article-title><source>Nature</source><volume>390</volume><fpage>74</fpage><lpage>77</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9363892</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003872-Polymenidou2"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Polymenidou</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Stoeck</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Glatzel</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Vey</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bellon</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Coexistence of multiple PrPSc types in individuals with Creutzfeldt-Jakob disease.</article-title><source>Lancet Neurol</source><volume>4</volume><fpage>805</fpage><lpage>814</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16297838</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003872-Sigurd